cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FreEM resources, please cite the project as below. Each corpus has its own citation file in its repository."
type: dataset
title: "FreEM: corpora and NLP models for Early Modern French"
abstract: >-
  FreEM provides open corpora and NLP models for Early Modern French
  (16th–18th centuries): lemmatisation, part-of-speech tagging, morphology,
  spelling normalisation and named entity recognition.
